  "sourceTitle": "Mango Salsa",
  "sourceText": "Mango Salsa\nBy: Curt\nPublished: Friday, January 1, 2010 - 12:21am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 fresh mango, diced\n1/4 cup red onion, chopped\n2 tablespoons fresh cilantro, chopped\nJuice of one lime\n2 tablespoons olive oil\n1 teaspoon salt\nFresh ground black pepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a bowl, combine all of the above ingredients.\n\nAbout\n\n\nOptional: 1 small Thai chili pepper or 1/2 jalapeno pepper, seeded and finely chopped.\nA better Optional:  2 ounces of Thai Sweet Chili Sauce\nExcellent served with fish, such as grilled tuna.",
